cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Sparky Stereo OS 9 \"Mashtabba\": the stereo 3D edition of SparkyLinux"
abstract: "Sparky Stereo OS 9 \"Mashtabba\" is Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł \"pavroo\" Pijanowski), based on Debian 14 \"Forky\", with KDE Plasma only: a desktop where stereo 3D is part of the system, from the graphics driver to the display, with the deepest colour the screen accepts. This is a development snapshot. Documents under CC BY 4.0; scripts and tools under GPL-2.0-or-later."
authors:
  - family-names: "Ramos"
    given-names: "Daniel Campos"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0001-4546-8673"
license:
  - CC-BY-4.0
  - GPL-2.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/Sparky-OS/sparky-stereo-os"
keywords:
  - "stereoscopic 3D"
  - "stereo desktop"
  - "HDMI 3D"
  - "side by side"
  - "KDE Plasma"
  - "KWin"
  - "Debian"
  - "SparkyLinux"
  - "Linux distribution"
  - "virtual reality"
